{
    "_comment": "Milo at the entrance of Rainbow Fields (after the Village boss). Still warm and proud of the player; first tiny crack.",
    "partner": "milo",
    "start": [
        {
            "if": {
                "flag": "talked:milo_rainbow"
            },
            "goto": "again"
        },
        "first"
    ],
    "nodes": {
        "first": {
            "do": {
                "flag": "talked:milo_rainbow"
            },
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "milo_rainbow_01",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "grin",
                    "text": "There you are! I heard the noise all the way from here. Big crash, lots of yelling. Was that you?"
                },
                {
                    "who": "player",
                    "pose": "grin",
                    "text": "...You heard that from here?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "milo_rainbow_02",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "smile",
                    "text": "Sound travels. Anyway. You beat it. The big grumpy thing. Honestly, I didn't think anyone could."
                },
                {
                    "id": "milo_rainbow_03",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "laugh",
                    "text": "How did you even- no, don't tell me. I'd just get jealous."
                },
                {
                    "id": "milo_rainbow_04",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "pointing",
                    "text": "Welcome to Rainbow Fields. Every colour you can think of, and a few you can't."
                },
                {
                    "id": "milo_rainbow_05",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "The flowers here are friendly. Mostly. Don't stare at them for too long. They stare back."
                },
                {
                    "id": "milo_rainbow_06",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "thinking",
                    "text": "Past the fields there's a forest made of sugar. You'll smell it before you see it."
                },
                {
                    "id": "milo_rainbow_07",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "shrug",
                    "text": "And another one of those guards. Bigger. Grumpier. Probably."
                }
            ],
            "then": "hub"
        },
        "before": {
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "milo_rainbow_08",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "Hm? I've been here for a while."
                },
                {
                    "id": "milo_rainbow_09",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "smile",
                    "text": "You walk slow. No offence."
                }
            ],
            "do": {
                "flag": "milo_rainbow:before"
            },
            "then": "hub"
        },
        "advice": {
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "milo_rainbow_10",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "serious",
                    "text": "Flowers that move are not flowers. That's the whole advice."
                },
                {
                    "id": "milo_rainbow_11",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "grin",
                    "text": "Oh, and if something sparkles in the grass, it's either gold or a very bad idea. Usually gold."
                }
            ],
            "do": {
                "flag": "milo_rainbow:advice"
            },
            "then": "hub"
        },
        "again": {
            "random_line": true,
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "milo_rainbow_12",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "smile",
                    "text": "Isn't it beautiful? I could stand here all day. I kind of do."
                },
                {
                    "id": "milo_rainbow_13",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "laugh",
                    "text": "Counted the colours once. Got to forty-two and then a flower bit me."
                },
                {
                    "id": "milo_rainbow_14",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "thinking",
                    "text": "You okay? You look like you're thinking hard. Don't think too hard here. It's a happy place."
                },
                {
                    "id": "milo_rainbow_15",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "The wind smells like candy today. That means the sweet forest is close."
                }
            ],
            "choices": [
                {
                    "text": "How did you get here before me?",
                    "goto": "before"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Any advice?",
                    "goto": "advice"
                },
                {
                    "text": "What's past the fields?",
                    "goto": "past"
                },
                {
                    "text": "See you around.",
                    "goto": "bye"
                }
            ]
        },
        "hub": {
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "milo_rainbow_16",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "smile",
                    "text": "So. Anything else on your mind?"
                }
            ],
            "choices": [
                {
                    "text": "How did you get here before me?",
                    "goto": "before"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Any advice?",
                    "goto": "advice"
                },
                {
                    "text": "What's past the fields?",
                    "goto": "past"
                },
                {
                    "text": "See you around.",
                    "goto": "bye"
                }
            ]
        },
        "past": {
            "do": {
                "flag": "milo_rainbow:past"
            },
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "milo_rainbow_17",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "pointing",
                    "text": "The Sugarwood Grove. Candy trees, syrup rivers. It smells amazing for about five minutes."
                },
                {
                    "id": "milo_rainbow_18",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "grin",
                    "text": "Then it smells like a dentist's nightmare."
                }
            ],
            "then": "hub"
        },
        "bye": {
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "milo_rainbow_19",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "smile",
                    "text": "Go get 'em. Carefully. Like, really carefully."
                }
            ]
        }
    }
